{"title":"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A line has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/6/b5663c6e94d6d3732dd7d817986db57fa7be6dcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = kx - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e382be12e5c9272e25f196b60dab1752cd07077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />. What is its <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept? Express your answer in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept of the equation is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. This means that we can set up an equation and solve for the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e4e593dde8f77173c330759edb45f367948d5f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = kx_{\\text{int}} - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/5/6655d2f0ceee351cd894ab57bded060bacfbafe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kx_{\\text{int}} = 0 + 6 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03a33c88f66bc20752b09db3945099af3bd14c61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{\\text{int}} = \\boxed {\\frac{6}{k}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"79\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005328\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 77/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2159/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.551      1 2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%    6.551      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35566:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005328 and revision id 277971. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}